   "date": "2017-08-10",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The member moved the second reading of the Education Services for Overseas Students Amendment Bill 2017, which amends two Acts to reduce financial burdens on education providers while improving student protection, and clarifies how the Tuition Protection Service (TPS) Director calculates provider levies."
  },
